env       |         |                                        |
          +---------|----------------------------------------+
                    V       ^                   ^
                .---.---.   |                   |
     +----------+-O | O-+---+        +----------+------------+
     |          `---^---'            | x: 2                  |
     V                         E1 -->| good-enough?: -+      |
parameters: x                        | improve: ...   |      |
body: (define good-enough? ...)      | sqrt-iter: ... |      |
      (define improve ...)           +----------------|------+
      (define sqrt-iter ...)          ^  ^            |     ^
      (sqrt-iter 1.0)                 |  |            V     |
